{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51650","headline":"筑塘 · 钱鏐","name":"筑塘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天分浙水应东溟，日夜波涛不暂停。\n千尺巨堤冲欲裂，万人力御势须平。\n吴都地窄兵师广，罗刹名高海衆狞。\n爲报龙神幷水府，钱塘且借作钱城。\n（〖1〗《全唐诗》卷八据《吴越备史》收「传语龙王并水府，钱塘借与筑钱城」二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}